{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_1.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the new crew member of a polar station, surrounded by frozen wastes and endless darkness. Every hour, a mysterious timer activates on the station. You have limited time to decipher the code and enter it into the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/gif1.gif?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/divided.png?t=1748539132\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_2.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have at your disposal a telephone and a station operating manual, which will become your trusted companions in this strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/divided.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_3.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each new code you decipher, you draw closer to uncovering the station\u2019s secrets\u2014but the risk of encountering the inexplicable grows ever higher. Mysterious figures in the windows, strange phone calls, and shadows moving at the edge of your vision will haunt your every step. Can you withstand the horrors that might become reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will not only test your wits but force you to confront your deepest fears. Prepare for relentless tension, intricate puzzles, and unpredictable plot twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Rubik\u2019s Cube Station, where your fears will become your fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Demo version includes the first 3 game days.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778080?t=1748539132","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778080?t=1748539132","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/9748dbeded322166fa76b85bf32a75f640d352ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748539132","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/9748dbeded322166fa76b85bf32a75f640d352ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748539132","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_1.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are the new crew member of a polar station, surrounded by frozen wastes and endless darkness. Every hour, a mysterious timer activates on the station. You have limited time to decipher the code and enter it into the terminal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/gif1.gif?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/divided.png?t=1748539132\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_2.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will have at your disposal a telephone and a station operating manual, which will become your trusted companions in this strange place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/Gif2.gif?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/divided.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/extras/en_3.png?t=1748539132\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With each new code you decipher, you draw closer to uncovering the station\u2019s secrets\u2014but the risk of encountering the inexplicable grows ever higher. Mysterious figures in the windows, strange phone calls, and shadows moving at the edge of your vision will haunt your every step. Can you withstand the horrors that might become reality?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game will not only test your wits but force you to confront your deepest fears. Prepare for relentless tension, intricate puzzles, and unpredictable plot twists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to the Rubik\u2019s Cube Station, where your fears will become your fuel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The Demo version includes the first 3 game days.</i></p>","developers":["PALINI"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3637770","name":"Hate You"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778080/7d31057770420a35d196ddaa782f5fb7638bdc31/header.jpg?t=1748539132","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257146958,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257146958/movie480.mp4?t=1748453511","max":"http://video.aka